  "description": "The concept of political hypocrisy refers to the act of holding contradictory beliefs or behaviors, especially when one's actions contradict their stated principles. The meme uses this concept to imply that Chuck Schumer is hypocritical for supporting a large border wall funding bill in 2014 but criticizing a smaller one proposed by a Republican in 2019.",
